{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13384","headline":"释奠武成王乐章 亚献终献 · 于邵","name":"释奠武成王乐章 亚献终献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贰觞以献，三变其终。\n顾此非馨，尚达斯衷。\n茅缩可致，神歆载融。\n始神翊周，拯溺除凶。\n时维降佑，永绝兴戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于邵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}